  "description": "OpenAI SDK integration for TokenRateGate. Prevents HTTP 429 errors with tiktoken-based token estimation and rate-limited ChatClient wrappers for GPT-4, GPT-3.5, and other OpenAI models.",
  "id": "TokenRateGate.OpenAI",
